{"id":"衛署藥製字第012828號","license":"衛署藥製字第012828號","name":"雅露佳錠","english":"ALUZAINE TABLETS","version":"2","date":"2026-03-02","ingredient":"成 分：每錠含\nPolymagal (MgO:Al2O3=1:1)........................400 MG\nOxethazaine.....................................................10 MG\nDried Aluminum Hydroxide Gel..................32.5 MG","strength":"成 分:每錠含 Polymagal (MgO:Al2O3=1:1) 400 MG Oxethazaine 10 MG Dried Aluminum Hydroxide Gel 32.5 MG","category":"消系統","source_sha256":"e8293d279e2f9349fdeb17a85b0692318961ea8540bfab3859b9ca346e71dea9","sections":[{"id":"s1","parent":null,"no":"1","title":"性狀","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s2","parent":"s1","no":"1.1","title":"有效成分及含量","level":"2","html":"<p>成 分：每錠含<br>Polymagal (MgO:Al<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub>=1:1)........................400 MG<br>Oxethazaine.....................................................10 MG<br>Dried Aluminum Hydroxide Gel..................32.5 MG</p>","text":"成 分：每錠含\nPolymagal (MgO:Al2O3=1:1)........................400 MG\nOxethazaine.....................................................10 MG\nDried Aluminum Hydroxide Gel..................32.5 MG","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s3","parent":"s1","no":"1.2","title":"賦形劑","level":"2","html":"<p>Potato Starch、Carboxymethylcellulose Sodium、Sodium Starch Glycolate、Sodium Lauryl Sulfate、Water Purified、Alcohol 95%、Vegetable Magnesium Stearate、Glycyrrhiza Extract (Licorice Extracts)</p>","text":"Potato Starch、Carboxymethylcellulose Sodium、Sodium Starch Glycolate、Sodium Lauryl Sulfate、Water Purified、Alcohol 95%、Vegetable Magnesium Stearate、Glycyrrhiza Extract (Licorice Extracts)","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s4","parent":"s1","no":"1.3","title":"劑型","level":"2","html":"<p>錠劑</p>","text":"錠劑","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s5","parent":"s1","no":"1.4","title":"藥品外觀","level":"2","html":"<p>微黃色至黃色平面圓形錠，一面有橫刻剝半線，另一面標示*STANDARD*字樣。</p>","text":"微黃色至黃色平面圓形錠，一面有橫刻剝半線，另一面標示*STANDARD*字樣。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s6","parent":null,"no":"2","title":"適應症","level":"1","html":"<p>急、慢性胃炎所引起的胃痛、噁心、胃灼熱以及胃部不快感。</p>","text":"急、慢性胃炎所引起的胃痛、噁心、胃灼熱以及胃部不快感。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s7","parent":null,"no":"3","title":"用法及用量","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s8","parent":"s7","no":"3.1","title":"用法用量","level":"2","html":"<p>成人通常一次1~2錠，孩童半量。一日3~4次，每飯前15分鐘及就寢前服用。</p>","text":"成人通常一次1~2錠，孩童半量。一日3~4次，每飯前15分鐘及就寢前服用。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s9","parent":"s7","no":"3.2","title":"調製方式","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s10","parent":"s7","no":"3.3","title":"特殊族群用法用量","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s11","parent":null,"no":"4","title":"禁忌","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s12","parent":null,"no":"5","title":"警語及注意事項","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s13","parent":"s12","no":"5.1","title":"警語/注意事項","level":"2","html":"<p>腎衰竭病患長期服用含鋁胃藥可能導致或加重透析治療引起之透析性骨軟化症(Dialysis Osteomalacia)、透析性腦病變(Dialysis encephalopathy)及低磷血症，應謹慎小心使用。</p>","text":"腎衰竭病患長期服用含鋁胃藥可能導致或加重透析治療引起之透析性骨軟化症(Dialysis Osteomalacia)、透析性腦病變(Dialysis encephalopathy)及低磷血症，應謹慎小心使用。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s14","parent":"s12","no":"5.2","title":"藥物濫用及依賴性","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s15","parent":"s12","no":"5.3","title":"操作機械能力","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s16","parent":"s12","no":"5.4","title":"實驗室檢測","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s17","parent":"s12","no":"5.5","title":"其他注意事項","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s18","parent":null,"no":"6","title":"特殊族群注意事項","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s19","parent":"s18","no":"6.1","title":"懷孕","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s20","parent":"s18","no":"6.2","title":"哺乳","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s21","parent":"s18","no":"6.3","title":"有生育能力的女性與男性","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s22","parent":"s18","no":"6.4","title":"小兒","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s23","parent":"s18","no":"6.5","title":"老年人","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s24","parent":"s18","no":"6.6","title":"肝功能不全","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s25","parent":"s18","no":"6.7","title":"腎功能不全","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s26","parent":"s18","no":"6.8","title":"其他族群","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s27","parent":null,"no":"7","title":"交互作用","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s28","parent":null,"no":"8","title":"副作用/不良反應","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s29","parent":"s28","no":"8.1","title":"臨床重要副作用/不良反應","level":"2","html":"<p>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s30","parent":"s28","no":"8.2","title":"臨床試驗經驗","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s31","parent":"s28","no":"8.3","title":"上市後經驗","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s32","parent":null,"no":"9","title":"過量","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s33","parent":null,"no":"10","title":"藥理特性","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s34","parent":"s33","no":"10.1","title":"作用機轉","level":"2","html":"<p>胃炎或胃部疾患向來皆以飲食療法爲主，再併用制酸劑、抗膽素劑、黏膜保護劑的方法收效雖佳，但對於胃痛、嘔吐、悶胸、噁心等主訴緊迫症狀卻不易顯效。<br>通常之局部麻醉劑，因其毒性強易生耐藥性，唯獨Oxethazaine爲幾乎無此缺點之胃黏膜專用之局部麻醉劑，本公司再配合Polymagal之制酸劑而成「雅露佳」錠。</p>","text":"胃炎或胃部疾患向來皆以飲食療法爲主，再併用制酸劑、抗膽素劑、黏膜保護劑的方法收效雖佳，但對於胃痛、嘔吐、悶胸、噁心等主訴緊迫症狀卻不易顯效。\n通常之局部麻醉劑，因其毒性強易生耐藥性，唯獨Oxethazaine爲幾乎無此缺點之胃黏膜專用之局部麻醉劑，本公司再配合Polymagal之制酸劑而成「雅露佳」錠。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s35","parent":"s33","no":"10.2","title":"藥效藥理特性","level":"2","html":"<p>解除急性胃炎症狀(但弱酸性及無酸性胃炎例外)。</p><p>可除去由胃炎引起的胃痛、噁心、胃灼熱、 胃不快感、嘔吐等症狀，且可抑制胃機能的異常亢進。<br>消去便意頻迫症狀。<br>胃痛時胃腸反射刺激亢進屢使便意頻繁，「雅露佳」錠可緩和胃腸反射感度，改善便意頻迫症狀。<br>作用持續長久。</p><p>Oxethazaine絕少被吸收，LD<sub>50</sub>為1.8/kg 毒性極低，配合Polymagal可延續其作用時間，Polymagal為持續性制酸劑，可保護胃粘膜，但不引起便秘和下痢。</p>","text":"解除急性胃炎症狀(但弱酸性及無酸性胃炎例外)。\n可除去由胃炎引起的胃痛、噁心、胃灼熱、 胃不快感、嘔吐等症狀，且可抑制胃機能的異常亢進。\n消去便意頻迫症狀。\n胃痛時胃腸反射刺激亢進屢使便意頻繁，「雅露佳」錠可緩和胃腸反射感度，改善便意頻迫症狀。\n作用持續長久。\nOxethazaine絕少被吸收，LD50為1.8/kg 毒性極低，配合Polymagal可延續其作用時間，Polymagal為持續性制酸劑，可保護胃粘膜，但不引起便秘和下痢。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s36","parent":"s33","no":"10.3","title":"臨床前安全性資料","level":"2","html":"<p>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s37","parent":null,"no":"11","title":"藥物動力學特性","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s38","parent":null,"no":"12","title":"臨床試驗資料","level":"1","html":"<p>(依文獻記載)<br>目前尚無資訊</p>","text":"(依文獻記載)\n目前尚無資訊","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s39","parent":null,"no":"13","title":"包裝及儲存","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s40","parent":"s39","no":"13.1","title":"包裝","level":"2","html":"<p>6-1000錠鋁箔盒裝。<br>6-1000錠塑膠瓶裝。</p>","text":"6-1000錠鋁箔盒裝。\n6-1000錠塑膠瓶裝。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s41","parent":"s39","no":"13.2","title":"效期","level":"2","html":"<p>如外包裝所示</p>","text":"如外包裝所示","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s42","parent":"s39","no":"13.3","title":"儲存條件","level":"2","html":"<p>25°C以下乾燥避光處儲存。</p>","text":"25°C以下乾燥避光處儲存。","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s43","parent":"s39","no":"13.4","title":"儲存注意事項","level":"2","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s44","parent":null,"no":"14","title":"病人使用須知","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0},{"id":"s45","parent":null,"no":"15","title":"其他","level":"1","html":"","text":"","text_source":"VALUE","image_count":0}],"appearances":[{"SHAPE":"圓形","SCORE":"直線","COLOR1":"黃","COLOR1_DESC":"","COLOR2":"黃","COLOR2_DESC":"","SYMBOL":"有","SIZE":"11.0","MARK1":"STANDARD","MARK2":"","FILES":""}],"assets":[{"url":"data/assets/衛署藥製字第012828號/e8293d279e2f9349fdeb17a85b0692318961ea8540bfab3859b9ca346e71dea9-0.jpg","section_id":null,"label":"XML 附件圖片 1"}],"issues":[],"strength_source":"CONTENT/SECTION 1.1（逐字成分含量，保留單位基準）","conflict":false,"history":[{"version":"2","date":"2026-03-02","sha256":"e8293d279e2f9349fdeb17a85b0692318961ea8540bfab3859b9ca346e71dea9","data_url":"data/versions/衛署藥製字第012828號/e8293d279e2f9349fdeb17a85b0692318961ea8540bfab3859b9ca346e71dea9.json","section_count":45,"changed_sections":[]}],"data_url":"data/products/衛署藥製字第012828號.json"}